+---
+id: task-002-record-createdat-and-updatedat-on-every-task
+type: task
+title: "Record createdAt and updatedAt on every task"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings. They are equal when the task is
+added; every change (complete, reopen, rename, tag, untag) sets `updatedAt` to the time of the change.
+The domain does not read the clock (rule r3): the list takes a clock function, and `createTodoList` in
+`src/index.ts` supplies the real one.
